26:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-A sourced example: Passau M.Sc. Computer Science",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"A sourced example: Passau M.Sc. Computer Science"}],[["$","p","The University of Passau programme page states a German final grade of 2.7 or better, or a position among the best 70% of the graduating cohort. It also specifies a related degree with at least 110 ECTS in computer science; for a four-year non-ECTS degree, the page explains an approximately two-thirds computer-science-credit condition. This is a particular programme example, not a rule for every Passau course.",{"children":"The University of Passau programme page states a German final grade of 2.7 or better, or a position among the best 70% of the graduating cohort. It also specifies a related degree with at least 110 ECTS in computer science; for a four-year non-ECTS degree, the page explains an approximately two-thirds computer-science-credit condition. This is a particular programme example, not a rule for every Passau course."}],["$","p","Its FAQ explains the ranking alternative: the university-issued document must identify the cohort size and the applicant’s position. It also says the programme does not pre-screen degrees before an application. Do not substitute your own rank estimate for an institutional document or assume that satisfying the grade condition guarantees selection.",{"children":"Its FAQ explains the ranking alternative: the university-issued document must identify the cohort size and the applicant’s position. It also says the programme does not pre-screen degrees before an application. Do not substitute your own rank estimate for an institutional document or assume that satisfying the grade condition guarantees selection."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.uni-passau.de/en/msc-computer-science",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.uni-passau.de/en/msc-computer-science","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Passau programme requirements"}]]}],["$","span","https://www.uni-passau.de/en/msc-computer-science/faq-application-msc-computer-science",{"children":[" · ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.uni-passau.de/en/msc-computer-science/faq-application-msc-computer-science","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Passau application FAQ"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-Do not compare unlike grade scales",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Do not compare unlike grade scales"}],[["$","p","A Pakistani 2.7/4.0 and a German 2.7 are not the same measurement. Write down your transcript’s maximum, minimum passing grade and achieved grade, then read how the receiving institution evaluates foreign credentials. A planning calculator can help you understand inputs but cannot issue an official conversion.",{"children":"A Pakistani 2.7/4.0 and a German 2.7 are not the same measurement. Write down your transcript’s maximum, minimum passing grade and achieved grade, then read how the receiving institution evaluates foreign credentials. A planning calculator can help you understand inputs but cannot issue an official conversion."}],["$","p","Before using a conversion in a shortlist, identify what it is being used for: personal planning, a portal field or a formal evaluation. Keep your original result and scale visible. If the course asks for an official assessment or uses its own calculation, follow that instruction rather than replacing it with a generic online result.",{"children":"Before using a conversion in a shortlist, identify what it is being used for: personal planning, a portal field or a formal evaluation. Keep your original result and scale visible. If the course asks for an official assessment or uses its own calculation, follow that instruction rather than replacing it with a generic online result."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L29"]}],"$L2a","$L2b"]}]
27:["$","section",null,{"className":"source-section","aria-labelledby":"official-sources","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"official-sources","children":"Official sources and verification"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Source records support the guide. Page update dates describe editorial changes; they do not mean every linked rule was checked again today. Reopen the current call for your programme and intake."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"source-grid","children":[["$","$L5","https://www.uni-assist.de/en/how-to-apply/get-information/master/",{"href":"https://www.uni-assist.de/en/how-to-apply/get-information/master/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Uni-assist master’s application criteria"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Official source checked 1 November 2026."}]]}],["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M15 3h6v6","key":"1q9fwt"}],["path",{"d":"M10 14 21 3","key":"gplh6r"}],["path",{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6","key":"a6xqqp"}]],"className":"lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","https://www.uni-passau.de/en/msc-computer-science",{"href":"https://www.uni-passau.de/en/msc-computer-science","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Passau M.Sc. Computer Science"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Official source checked 1 November 2026."}]]}],["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$27:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","https://www.uni-passau.de/en/msc-computer-science/faq-application-msc-computer-science",{"href":"https://www.uni-passau.de/en/msc-computer-science/faq-application-msc-computer-science","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Passau application FAQ"}],["